      "arm by pressure interaction, with the same permutation test",
      "SimpleQA correct and not_attempted rates by arm and condition",
      "TruthfulQA non_answer rate by arm and condition"
    ],
    "limits": "One target model, one temperature, public items that may be in the target's training data, pressure wrappers written for this packet rather than taken from a published benchmark. A result is evidence about a constitution in the prompt, not about training. This is a development probe, not the G010 comparison."
